We have acquired information that suggests that the Chinese have a base capable of building a new portal. Although we are unsure of how correct this information is, we cannot take chances in this situation - the base is well-defended, and surrounded by minefields. You will need to build up an assault force and attack the base, to end once and for all the Red Army's ability to build Pegasus devices.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Destroy the Chinese base, and wreck their Pegasus production facility.

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
The base is extremely heavily defended. You will need to perform standard mine clearance procedures before you can even consider an assault, and there are plenty of gun towers. Your best tactic with the gun towers will be to take out their power sources quickly and cleanly, while the mines can be cleared with rockets or Stabber rounds. We believe there may be a shipment of supplies on its way in at some point, so be on your guard.